{"id": "lean_eval_simple", "tool": "lean_compile", "requires": ["lean"], "input": {"code": "#eval (1 + 1 : Nat)"}, "expect": {"ok": true}, "note": "最小可编译样例：不 import 任何东西，验证 lean 二进制本身可用"}
{"id": "lean_mathlib_tactic", "tool": "lean_compile", "requires": ["lean", "mathlib"], "input": {"code": "import Mathlib.Tactic\n#eval (1 + 1 : Nat)"}, "expect": {"ok": true}, "note": "Mathlib 子模块导入；本地无 Mathlib 会 SKIP"}
{"id": "lean_mathlib_bare", "tool": "lean_compile", "requires": ["lean", "mathlib"], "input": {"code": "import Mathlib\n#eval (1 + 1 : Nat)"}, "expect": {"ok": true}, "note": "★ 裸 import Mathlib 应被 _normalize_lean_imports 改写成 Mathlib.Tactic 从而通过；若这里 FAIL，说明归一化没生效（2026-10-24 云端实测：通过）"}
{"id": "lean_sorry_rejected", "tool": "lean_compile", "requires": ["lean", "mathlib"], "input": {"code": "import Mathlib.Tactic\ntheorem bad : (1:ℕ) + 1 = 3 := by sorry"}, "expect": {"ok": false, "error_contains": "不可信"}, "note": "含 sorry 必须被拒（防作弊门①）"}
{"id": "lean_axiom_rejected", "tool": "lean_compile", "requires": ["lean", "mathlib"], "input": {"code": "import Mathlib.Tactic\naxiom cheat : (1:ℕ) + 1 = 3\ntheorem bad2 : (1:ℕ) + 1 = 3 := cheat"}, "expect": {"ok": false, "error_contains": "不可信"}, "note": "含 axiom 必须被拒（防作弊门③）"}
{"id": "lean_syntax_error", "tool": "lean_compile", "requires": ["lean"], "input": {"code": "theorem broken : = 3 := by"}, "expect": {"ok": false}, "note": "语法错误必须如实报错，不能包装成成功"}
{"id": "lean_false_statement", "tool": "lean_compile", "requires": ["lean", "mathlib"], "input": {"code": "import Mathlib.Tactic\ntheorem two_eq_three : (2:ℕ) = 3 := by norm_num"}, "expect": {"ok": false}, "note": "★ 伪命题：命题本身为假，norm_num 证不出来 —— 验证 Lean 不会因为写法规整就放行"}
{"id": "mcp_run_code_eval", "tool": "lean_mcp", "requires": ["lean", "mathlib"], "input": {"code": "#eval (1 + 1 : Nat)"}, "expect": {"ok": true, "items_min": 1}, "note": "MCP 通道最小调用（曾因 lake 不在 PATH 全废）"}
{"id": "obligation_squeezed", "tool": "obligation_selfcheck", "requires": [], "input": {"obligations": [{"oid": "O5", "statement": "对任意 m<n，(m+n)D \\le 777^2 成立"}]}, "expect": {"n_suspects": 1, "kind": "target_squeezed"}, "note": "待求量被变量因子压死 —— 真实踩过的义务错误"}
{"id": "obligation_normal", "tool": "obligation_selfcheck", "requires": [], "input": {"obligations": [{"oid": "O1", "statement": "对任意 m<n，D \\le 777^2"}]}, "expect": {"n_suspects": 0}, "note": "正常上界不得误报"}
{"id": "obligation_construct", "tool": "obligation_selfcheck", "requires": [], "input": {"obligations": [{"oid": "O2", "statement": "存在序列 x_n 使 (m+n)|x_n^2-x_m^2| \\ge D"}]}, "expect": {"n_suspects": 0}, "note": "构造存在式不得误报"}
